{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Campaign</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick the right units on a constrained budget and place them in strategic positions to defeat the enemy warbots! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each warbot has its strengths and weaknesses so picking the right ones is key to your victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the battle starts, you can let your warbots do their thing or command them directly, RTS-style. You can even control individual warbots in third-person mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo will have a sample campaign for you to try out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681680/extras/cxcvxvcxv.gif?t=1745575346\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Sandbox</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sandbox mode is where you can let your imagination go wild. Build your own maps and simulate any battle you want involving any warbots you want! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo will only a small number of warbots for you to try out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681680/extras/sss.gif?t=1745575346\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Warbot Editor</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create your own custom warbots to be used in the sandbox mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo will have a limited number of blocks and weapons to play with but should give you\u00a0 a good idea of how fun the warbot editor can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681680/extras/Rev_2_.gif?t=1745575346\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681680?t=1745575346","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681680?t=1745